OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThis morning, some cloud is
OL,6,Flingering across northern coasts, but
OL,7,Felsewhere inland there is dense fog
OL,8,Fwhich will gradually clear. Becoming
OL,9,Fcloudy by lunchtime perhaps with the
OL,10,Fodd spot of rain, but with occasional
OL,11,Fbright spells in the afternoon. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy through the night,
OL,14,Fwith spots of rain continuing and
OL,15,Fperhaps some heavy spells in the east
OL,16,Flater during the night. Light winds to
OL,17,Fstart but becoming breezy by sunrise.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
