OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FOn Wednesday, outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain will clear eastwards leaving
OL,7,Fsunny spells and a cooler feel in a
OL,8,Ffresh northerly breeze. Some light
OL,9,Fshowers arriving in the west during
OL,10,Fthe evening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FOn
OL,13,FThursday, sunny spells with showers
OL,14,Feasing, and feeling cool in a
OL,15,Fnorthwesterly breeze. Cloud thickening
OL,16,Finto Friday, bringing rain and
OL,17,Fblustery winds. Becoming more settled
OL,18,Fon Saturday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
